    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d667-a1">

                <pb facs="0648" n="1382" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1382"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 710.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Tevfik Pasha.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-12-05"><hi rendition="#italic">December 5,
                        1895</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 102.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Just as whenever a complaint becomes
                    necessary I deem it my duty to present it to the Sublime Porte, so in the
                    present instance, when the conduct of certain army officers and civil
                    functionaries of Harpoot, Marsovan, Aintab, and Amassia, whose names are
                    appended, is worthy of the highest praise on account of their protection of the
                    lives of American missionaries, I take great pleasure in transmitting to your
                    excellency the expression of the deep satisfaction I have felt on hearing of
                    their meritorious action, of which I am also informing my Government.</p>
                <p>Mehmet Bey, alai beyi of Harpoot; the kaimakam of Aintab; Bekir Pasha,
                    moutessarif of Amassia; the kaimakam of Marsovan, and the colonel commanding the
                    troops at Marsovan.</p>
                <p>Receive, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
